               <p xml:id="idm151">On 6 September 1864 the daughter of King Christian IX, Princess Alexandra, and her husband Edward, Prince of Wales arrived at Elsinore on a family visit bringing with them their eight-month old son Prince Albert Victor. They stayed in Scandinavia for seven weeks. For this occasion Gade wrote a new version of "Et Farvel" with orchestra.</p>
